1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:03,080
Seen... aur koi jawab nahi.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:08,210
Mahadev, jin par bharosa karo... wahi hurt kyun karte hain?

3
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,920
Kisi aur ka vyavhaar... tumhari keemat tay nahi karta.

4
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:16,948
Par ab dobara kisi pe trust kaise karun?

5
00:00:17,398 --> 00:00:20,753
Bharosa karna mat chhodo... bas apni seemayein pehchano.

6
00:00:21,203 --> 00:00:25,992
Matlab maaf karun... par wapas wahi jagah dena zaroori nahi?

7
00:00:25,942 --> 00:00:29,780
Bilkul. Karuna aur apni raksha... dono saath chal sakte hain.

8
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:34,487
Dil saaf rakhungi... aur darwaza samajhdaari se kholungi.
